---
layout: base.njk
title: Writing
description: Essays and short pieces by Ran Craycraft on leading through the AI era, building businesses, and making things.
permalink: /writing/
section: writing
---
<header class="page-head">
  <h1 class="page-title serif">Writing</h1>
  <div class="grid">
    <p class="span-main lede serif">Shorter thoughts on leading through the AI era, building businesses, and what I’m noticing along the way. The bigger work is under <a href="/stories/" class="ul">Stories</a>, and things I’ve built are under <a href="/making/" class="ul">Making</a>.</p>
  </div>
</header>

{%- set posts = collections.posts | ofKind("writing") %}
{%- if posts.length %}
<section class="section grid list-section" aria-labelledby="here-h">
  <h2 id="here-h" class="rail eyebrow strong">On this site</h2>
  <ol class="span-main entries">
    {%- for p in posts %}
    <li><a href="{{ p.url }}" class="entry">
      <span class="entry-title serif">{{ p.data.title }}</span>
      <span class="entry-desc">{{ p.data.description }}</span>
      <span class="meta"><time datetime="{{ p.date | isoDate }}" data-relative>{{ p.date | readableDate }}</time></span>
    </a></li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>
{%- endif %}

<section class="section grid list-section" aria-labelledby="elsewhere-h">
  <div class="rail">
    <h2 id="elsewhere-h" class="eyebrow strong">On the thoughtbot blog</h2>
    <p class="rail-note">Each links to the original.</p>
  </div>
  <ol class="span-main entries">
    {%- for e in elsewhere %}
    <li><a href="{{ e.url }}" class="entry">
      <span class="entry-title serif">{{ e.title }}</span>
      <span class="entry-desc">{{ e.summary }}</span>
      <span class="meta"><time datetime="{{ e.date | isoDate }}" data-relative>{{ e.date | readableDate }}</time>{% if e.coauthor %}<span class="dot">·</span>with {{ e.coauthor }}{% endif %}<span class="dot">·</span>{{ e.publication }} <span class="ext" aria-label="opens the original">↗</span></span>
    </a></li>
    {%- endfor %}
  </ol>
</section>
